(MASTER SERVICES AGREEMENT \(V2\)) '
() '
(This Master Services Agreement \("Agreement"\) is entered into and made effective) '
(as of October 1, 2026 \("Effective Date"\), by and between:) '
() '
(Party A: Apex Horizon Cloud Ltd., a commercial enterprise organized and existing) '
(under the commercial laws of the Dubai International Financial Centre, with) '
(executive offices at Level 14, Al Fattan Currency House, DIFC, Dubai, UAE) '
(\("Service Provider"\), and) '
() '
(Party B: Beacon Oasis Logistics FZ-LLC, a free zone limited liability company) '
(organized and existing under the regulations of Dubai South, with offices at) '
(Building A3, Logistics District, Dubai South, UAE \("Customer"\).) '
() '
(RECITALS) '
(WHEREAS, Customer desires to procure enterprise cloud logistics orchestration,) '
(cargo analytics telemetry, and automated clearance infrastructure services; and) '
(WHEREAS, Service Provider develops and operates high-availability cloud) '
(platforms and wishes to deliver such managed services in accordance with this) '
(Agreement.) '
() '
(NOW, THEREFORE, the parties mutually covenant and agree as follows:) '
() '
(SECTION 1. DEFINITIONS AND RULES OF INTERPRETATION) '
() '
(1.1 "Affiliate" means any entity that directly or indirectly controls, is) '
(controlled by, or is under common corporate ownership with an applicable party.) '
(1.2 "Agreement" means this Master Services Agreement, together with all executed) '
(Statements of Work, Service Level Agreements, and annexed Schedules.) '
(1.3 "Applicable Law" means all statutory enactments, administrative orders,) '
(decrees, and regulatory rules in force within the United Arab Emirates and the) '
(DIFC.) '
(1.4 "Business Day" means any day excluding Saturdays, Sundays, and official) '
(public holidays recognized by the government of the United Arab Emirates.) '
(1.5 "Customer Data" means all operational records, waybills, cargo manifests,) '
(and electronic transmissions submitted to the Service Provider by Customer.) '
(1.6 "Deliverables" means all architectural designs, telemetry pipelines, and) '
(customized modules delivered to Customer under an applicable Statement of Work.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
