(a continuous period of one hundred and eighty \(180\) calendar days following) '
(final acceptance by the Customer.) '
() '
(2.6 Remedy for Non-Conformance. If Customer gives written notice of any defect) '
(within the warranty period, Service Provider shall remediate without cost within) '
(ten \(10\) Business Days.) '
() '
(SECTION 3. SERVICE LEVEL COMMITMENTS AND AVAILABILITY) '
() '
(3.1 System Availability Target. Service Provider commits to maintain production) '
(platform availability of at least 99.9% across each calendar billing month.) '
(3.2 Excluded Downtime. Availability calculations shall exclude planned) '
(maintenance windows scheduled between 02:00 and 06:00 Gulf Standard Time.) '
(3.3 Service Credits. If availability falls below 99.9%, Customer shall receive a) '
(credit equal to 5% of monthly fees for each full 0.5% degradation.) '
(3.4 Sole Remedy. The service credits provided under this Section 3 shall) '
(constitute Customer's sole monetary remedy for platform downtime.) '
(3.5 Monitoring Reports. Service Provider shall publish monthly uptime records to) '
(Customer's designated administrative dashboard.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
