(SECTION 5. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS AND LICENSING) '
() '
(5.1 Service Provider Background IP. Service Provider retains sole and exclusive) '
(title to all pre-existing software, algorithms, models, and core engines.) '
(5.2 Customer License. Service Provider grants Customer a non-exclusive,) '
(non-transferable license to access and utilize the platform during the Term.) '
(5.3 Deliverables and Custom Code. Unless otherwise specified in an SOW, custom) '
(workflow integrations created specifically for Customer shall vest in Customer.) '
(5.4 Restrictions. Customer shall not decompile, reverse-engineer, distribute, or) '
(create derivative works of Service Provider Background IP.) '
(5.5 IP Audits and Compliance Verification. Either party may verify compliance) '
(with license scopes upon fourteen \(14\) days advance written notice.) '
(Each party shall bear its own internal administrative costs, legal fees, and) '
(operational expenses incurred in connection with its performance and compliance) '
(obligations under this Section.) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
