(SECTION 9. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY AND DAMAGES) '
() '
(9.1 Aggregate Liability Cap. Subject to Section 9.3, each party's aggregate) '
(cumulative liability arising out of or related to this Agreement shall be) '
(strictly capped at and limited to AED 1,000,000.) '
(9.2 Consequential Damages Exclusion. Neither party shall be liable for indirect,) '
(incidental, special, punitive, or consequential losses, or loss of profits.) '
(9.3 Uncapped Liabilities. Nothing in this Agreement shall exclude or limit) '
(liability for gross negligence, willful misconduct, or indemnification under) '
(Section 8.) '
(9.4 Mitigation of Losses. Both parties shall take all commercially reasonable) '
(actions to mitigate damages arising from any breach or claim.) '
() '
ET
endstream
