(SECTION 11. NON-SOLICITATION OF PERSONNEL) '
() '
(11.1 Non-Solicitation. During the Term and for a period of twelve \(12\) months) '
(following termination, neither party shall directly solicit for employment any) '
(personnel of the other party involved in the delivery or receipt of the) '
(Services.) '
() '
(SECTION 12. NOTICES AND OFFICIAL COMMUNICATIONS) '
() '
(12.1 Delivery Method. All legal notices shall be in writing and delivered by) '
(hand, registered courier, or confirmed digital transmission.) '
(12.2 Contact Addresses. Notices to Service Provider: Level 14, Al Fattan) '
(Currency House, DIFC, Dubai. Notices to Customer: Building A3, Dubai South.) '
() '
(SECTION 13. FORCE MAJEURE AND EXCUSABLE DELAYS) '
() '
(13.1 Excusable Delay. Neither party shall be liable for delay or failure caused) '
(by acts of God, armed conflict, national cyber disasters, or grid outages.) '
(13.2 Notice of Delay. The affected party must deliver written notification) '
(within forty-eight \(48\) hours detailing the event and estimated duration.) '
() '
ET
endstream
