(SCHEDULE A: SERVICES SPECIFICATION AND SERVICE LEVELS) '
() '
(1. Core Cloud Logistics Platform.) '
(Service Provider shall deploy, host, and maintain the multi-tenant telemetry) '
(gateway and clearance routing services in dedicated regional data centers.) '
() '
(2. Performance SLA Targets.) '
(- Production Service Availability: 99.9% uptime per calendar month.) '
(- Critical Incident Response Time: Within fifteen \(15\) minutes, available 24) '
(hours per day, 7 days per week.) '
(- Major Incident Response Time: Within sixty \(60\) minutes during standard UAE) '
(Business Hours.) '
() '
(3. Backup and Disaster Recovery.) '
(- Recovery Point Objective \(RPO\): Maximum fifteen \(15\) minutes of data loss.) '
(- Recovery Time Objective \(RTO\): Maximum four \(4\) hours to restore full) '
(operational services.) '
() '
ET
endstream
